  "import-attachments-zip": "ZIP ya dikgokaganywa tša Trello (ya boikgethelo, go tšwa go Trello Card Attachments Downloader)",
  "import-trello-json-file": "Faele ya Trello ya .json",
  "import-trello-json-file-hint": "Boto e tee ya Trello ye e ntšhitšwego bjalo ka .json. Ge o bolokile senotlelo le token tša Trello API, dikgokaganywa tša yona, bokamorago bja boto le diswantšho tša profaele tša maloko le tšona di a laollwa.",
  "import-trello-zip-file": "Faele ya Trello ya .zip",
  "import-trello-zip-file-hint": ".zip ye e nago le faele e tee goba tše dintši tša boto tša .json le dikgokaganywa tša tšona ka difoldareng tša maina a boto (go tšwa go Trello Card Attachments Downloader). Diboto ka moka di a tlišwa.",
