  "password-length-filter-all": "Ka moka",
  "password-length-filter-fixed": "Go lokišitšwe go lentšu la sephiri le letelele ka mo go lekanego",
  "password-length-filter-short": "Lentšu la sephiri le lekopana kudu",
  "password-length-first-login": "Go tsena ga mathomo",
  "password-length-fixed": "Go lokišitšwe",
  "password-length-from-environment": "Boleng bjo bo beakantšwego tikologong ya seabi bo a šoma; go boloka mo go bo phala.",
  "password-length-last-login": "Go tsena ga mafelelo",
  "password-length-login-count": "Palo ya go tsena",
  "password-length-no-results": "Ga go na diakhaonte mo.",
  "password-length-report-desc": "Diakhaonte tšeo di tsenego ka lentšu la sephiri le lekopana go feta botelele bjo bonnyane. Ke sefetleki fela seo se tsebago gore lentšu la sephiri le letelele gakaakang, ka fao se bega le lekopana ka morago ga go tsena; lentšu la sephiri le botelele bja lona ga di ke di tšwa go sona. Go lokišitšwe ke nako yeo lentšu la sephiri la akhaonte le fetošitšwego - akhaonte yeo e tsenago gape ka lentšu la sephiri le lekopana e bontšhwa gape bjalo ka e kopana kudu.",
  "password-length-saved": "Go bolokilwe.",
  "password-min-length": "Botelele bjo bonnyane bja lentšu la sephiri",
  "password-min-length-description": "Go tsena ka lentšu la sephiri le lekopana go ngwadilwe ka fase. Go tsena ga go ke go ganwa ka lebaka la seo.",
  "password-min-length-enforce": "Gapeletša botelele bjo bonnyane",
  "password-min-length-enforce-description": "Lentšu la sephiri le lefsa le lekopana le a ganwa, gomme akhaonte yeo e tsenago ka lentšu la sephiri le lekopana e swanetše go le fetoša pele ga selo se sengwe le se sengwe. Go le fetoša go ntšha mananeo ka moka a akhaonte. Mantšu a sephiri a LDAP, OAuth2, OIDC, SAML, CAS le Sandstorm ke a mofani wa ona, gomme ga a hlahlobjwe.",
  "password-change-required-text": "Saete ye bjale e nyaka mantšu a sephiri a nago le bonnyane bja dihlaka tše __min__, gomme la gago le lekopana. Kgetha le letelele gore o tšwele pele. Ke moka mananeo ka moka a akhaonte ya gago a a tšwa, gomme o tsena gape ka lentšu la sephiri le lefsa.",
  "date-format-for-everyone": "Sebopego sa letšatšikgwedi sa bohle",
  "calendar-system": "Mokgwa wa khalentara (go bontšha letšatšikgwedi)",
  "show-unread-changes": "Swaya dikarata tše di fetogilego go tloga ge ke di bula la mafelelo",
  "show-unread-changes-desc": "Karata yeo sehlogo, tlhalošo, matšatši, diswayo, maloko, malokelelo a tlhahlobo, ditlaleletšo goba ditshwaotshwao tša yona di fetogilego ka morago ga ge o e bula la mafelelo, e hwetša molomo o motala-lewatle karateng ya yona ye nnyane, go fihlela o e bula.",
  "keep-title-tags": "Boloka #leswayo le @leloko ditlhogong tša dikarata tše mpsha",
  "keep-title-tags-description": "Ge o kgetha leswayo ka # goba leloko ka @ ge o ngwala sehlogo sa karata ye mpsha, boloka sengwalwa seo le ka sehlogong. Go timilwe: sengwalwa se tšeelwa legato ke leswayo goba leloko.",
  "show-focus-outline": "Bontšha mothalo wa tlhokomelo",
  "keep-add-card-form-open": "Tlogela foromo ya go oketša karata e butšwe ka morago ga go oketša karata",
  "keep-add-card-form-open-description": "Bulegile: ka morago ga ge karata e okeditšwe, foromo e dula e butšwe ka thaetlele ye e se nago selo bakeng sa karata ye e latelago. Tswaletšwe: foromo e a tswalega ge karata e okeditšwe.",
  "title-bracket-label": "Fetola [leswayo] mathomong a sehlogo sa karata ye mpsha go ba leswayo",
  "title-bracket-label-description": "Ge sehlogo sa karata ye mpsha se thoma ka [Sengwalwa] gomme sa latelwa ke sengwalwa se sengwe, Sengwalwa se ba leswayo la karata (le a hlolwa ge poto e se na leswayo la leina leo) gomme sa tlošwa sehlogong. Go timilwe: sehlogo se dula bjalo ka ge se le.",
  "submit-on-enter": "Romela barulaganyi ka Enter",
  "submit-on-enter-description": "Ge se buletšwe, go gatelela Enter go boloka sehlogo sa karata, tlhaloso le barulaganyi ba bangwe ba mothalading; Shift+Enter e tsenya mothalo wo moswa. Ge se timilwe, Ctrl/Cmd+Enter e a boloka gomme Enter e tsenya mothalo wo moswa.",
  "open-many-cards-at-once": "Bula dikarata tše dintši ka nako e tee",
  "open-many-cards-at-once-description": "Boloka karata ye nngwe le ye nngwe ye o e kgotlago e butšwe lefasetereng la yona. Ge se se timilwe, go kgotla karata go tswalela ye e bego e butšwe.",
  "checklist-ding-sound": "Bapala modumo ge selo sa lenaneo la tlhahlobo se feditšwe",
  "checklist-ding-sound-description": "E bapala modumo o mokopana ge o tshwaya selo sa lenaneo la tlhahlobo. E timilwe ka tlhago.",
  "calendar-system-gregorian": "Gregoriana",
  "calendar-system-jalali": "Khalentara ya Jalali (ya Peresia)",
