  "draggable": "E ka gogwa",
  "restore-card-wip-limit-reached": "Lelokelelo __list__ le fihlile mollwaneng wa lona wa WIP. Bušetša karata go lelokelelo le lengwe:",
  "restore-card-no-list-with-room": "Lelokelelo le lengwe le le lengwe mo potong ye le fihlile mollwaneng wa lona wa WIP. Oketša mollwane, goba šuthiša goba iša polokelong dikarata, gore o bušetše karata ye.",
  "restore-all-skipped-wip-limit": "Dikarata tše __count__ ga se tša bušetšwa: malokelelo a tšona a fihlile mellwaneng ya ona ya WIP. Di bušetše e tee ka e tee gore o kgethe lelokelelo le lengwe.",
  "card-blocked": "E thibilwe",
  "class-of-service": "Legoro la tirelo",
